	"_notes": [
		"Data-driven species registry (veg overhaul Phase 5). Loaded by",
		"vegetation/veg_species_registry.gd; VegSpeciesCatalog remains the code",
		"facade. family = procedural builder in VegetationCardFactory.",
		"phenology drives seasonal response (VegetationEnvironmentSync):",
		"  conifer / evergreen / tropical_evergreen -> no autumn drop;",
		"  deciduous -> full autumn color + leaf fall; semi_deciduous -> partial.",
		"climate.abs_lat_* bound auto-scatter (BiomePalette climate filter);",
		"climate.min_winter_c is recorded for the Phase 6 weather refinement.",
		"food yields are per MATURE tree per year, kcal per kg edible portion;",
		"harvest doys may wrap the new year (start > end). Consumed by Phase 10.",
		"photocard: optional texture id; a PNG at",
		"assets/vegetation/photocards/<id>.png (or user://veg_photocards/) swaps",
		"that species to textured crossed cards automatically."
	],
